== Synergies ==
* {{A|Golden Trinket|r+}} / {{I|Mom's Box|r+}}: Each copy increase the speed of orbitals.
* {{I|Spin to Win}}: Familiars made into orbitals by Friendship Necklace can deal contact damage and block enemy shots while Spin to Win is active.

== Interactions ==
* {{T|Child Leash}}: Familiars will orbit much closer to Isaac.
* {{I|King Baby}}: Familiars will orbit King Baby at all times instead of Isaac, even while not firing. King Baby itself is unaffected.
* {{c|Lilith}} + {{i|Birthright}}: Lilith’s Birthright effect overrides Friendship Necklace.

